{
  "scenario_name": "swarm_gpu_smoke",
  "description": "Drive Main Menu -> Settings -> Debug tab -> Test Scenarios -> GPU Bots -> Start, then cycle the bot-count ladder (4 -> 8 -> 16 -> 32 -> 64 -> 128) via ACTION_TESTSCEN_CYCLE_COUNT (KEY_0 / scancode 39). Verifies the GPU compute path activation (probe GL >= 4.3, compute shader compile+link), benchmark logging (BENCHMARK.SWARM.GPU), and how far the ladder progresses before the B-311 FATAL display-list crash trips at the 128-bot cycle. Surfaces the documented GPU pipeline structural gaps -- no bot AI (B-308), no collision constraints (B-309), no spawn upgrades (B-310), and the SWARM_GPU_MAX=256 hard cap vs CPU TESTSCEN_SWARM_MAX_COUNT=4096 drift (HF-2). Failure is informative: an EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION at the 128-step confirms B-311 unfixed; a missing BENCHMARK.SWARM.GPU line indicates the keystroke-only harness could not click the ImGui Start button (HIGH severity tooling gap). Input timings are Phase 1 scaffolding -- tune on first live run; the harness JSON + assertions are the deliverable.",
  "tags": ["debug", "swarm", "gpu", "benchmark", "scaling", "compute"],
  "paths_of_interest": [
    "port/fast3d/swarm_gpu.cpp",
    "port/src/testscenarios.c",
    "port/src/swarm_test.c",
    "port/fast3d/gfx_sdl2.cpp",
    "port/fast3d/pdgui_menu_mainmenu.cpp",
    "port/fast3d/pdgui_backend.cpp",
    "port/src/actionmap.cpp"
  ],
  "log_channel_mask": "all",
  "verbose": 0,
  "timeout_seconds": 240,
  "install_state": "clean",
  "boot_args": [
    "--no-update-check",
    "--no-sound"
  ],
  "input_sequence": [
